@startuml
title Counter workflow and live refresh
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
actor Barista
participant "Staff UI" as UI
participant "Orders API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Socket.IO gateway" as WS
participant "Customer UI" as Customer
Barista -> UI: Approve / ready / handed over
UI -> API: PATCH status with JWT
API -> API: Check BARISTA and DTO
API -> DB: Begin; lock Order, reread state
API -> API: Check transition and pending exchange
API -> DB: Conditional update; commit
API -> WS: notifyOrdersChanged AFTER commit
WS --> UI: orders.changed (no payload)
WS --> Customer: orders.changed (no payload)
UI -> API: GET staff orders with staff permission
Customer -> API: GET own order with ownership check
API -> DB: Read committed state
API --> UI: Queue state
API --> Customer: Own order state
note over UI, Customer: Reconnect refresh and visible-tab HTTP polling are fallback paths.
@enduml
